    "Description": "The kernel-rt packages provide the Real Time Linux Kernel, which enables fine-tuning for systems with extremely high determinism requirements.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* kernel: net: usb: smsc75xx: Limit packet length to skb-\u003elen (CVE-2023-53125)\n\n* kernel: ipv6: mcast: Delay put pmc-\u003eidev in mld_del_delrec() (CVE-2025-38550)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
